<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Zake</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zake Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zake</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zak</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zake</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Nui ta nii daasei ge ɠɛni ga Zake, naa é Zake Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠɛai. É ɠɛni tanisu ga Yesu deeloin, é ɠɛni ga totuɠɔi ta Egilisi mɔungi zu, pɔ ge ɠɛni totuɠɔiti ta-maaɓɔgi ʋa, nii é ɠɛɛni Zeluzalɛme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:13">KKw 15:13</ref></char>). Keelai Pɔle daasei pɛɛʋɛ ɓalaa ga Egilisii «ma ɓɛdɛgi ta» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:9">Gal 2:9</ref></char>). Faaɠwɛ nuiti daaʋɛ da ga Zake Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ɠɛɠala, Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma. Tɛi Zake ɠɛni ga Egilisi lotuɠɔi ta Zeluzalɛme, tanisu kɛai ma ná, názu ɠa é sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zake Ná-Sɛʋɛi leʋegɛ «GALA ná-boloda puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12), ti vazagai eteai zu ná pɛ» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). Kalagi niiti ti Zake Ná-Sɛʋɛi zu, ta keletiɛinti tɔnɔ, kɛlɛ wooi é bosu náʋɛ «boloda puugɔ maazu felegɔiti» (12), naa ɠa dɛɛzu ga é sɛʋɛi leʋeni ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ keletiɛinti ma, ti ga Zuifuiti. Sɛʋɛi nii ɠa kala mɔinmɔin feezu, tɔɔzei teʋegɛ ga é zeeli kpɔ mɔinmɔin ma, ti kala. Zake laaɓakpagɛ kidaaleʋeiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ma ta kɛɛwotiiti. Kidaaleʋe ɠitei ɠa ɗa ɠula kɛlɛma ga kɛɛwotiiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:17">2:17</ref></char>). É dɛɛʋɛ ɓalaa ga kɛni nu dama ga zeelɔzɔɠɔzu vai, é lo naavolo nuiti ba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-4">2:1-4</ref></char>), é ɠɛ ade dama ɓalaa ga wooi, niiti ti ɠulazu ade laaʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Zake ɠa naati tuʋɔsu, niiti ti ʋaazu ná-sɛʋɛi ɠalasu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋolu é keletiɛinti iɲɔdɔ, ga ti yiilɔɔ siɛgi zu kpɔlɔi zeelizu la ti ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-27">1:2-27</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. É zɛba é ɠɛ ma, toɠa ga faa ʋagɔ ga kidaaleʋei ɠula kɛlɛma ga kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-26">2:1-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Naa ɓegai ma, zɛbɛi nii a zoo ɠɛɛzu nu laawooiti ba, é naa ɓalaa lɛɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Naa ʋoluma Zake dɛɛʋɛ ga GALA ná-ɠimalai ta nuɓusɛi ná-ɠimalai ti yeeɠaaɠwɛɛʋɛ gola (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:13-4:10">3:13—4:10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">6. É ná-sɛʋɛi ɠala nuiti tooni ɠisu naa ʋoluma ɓɔɠɔvaalɛsui laalɔɠɔma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:11-5:6">4:11—5:6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Zake Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelagɛ ga, é kiti levei tanigaa ve (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5:7-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Zake, gè ga GALA ta Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ta-wotiɠɛ nu, nà wo luʋɔsu, GALA ná-boloda puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12), ti vazagai eteai zu ná pɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suɠɔɠɔgi ta ziilɔɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, siɛgi zu wo lɔɔzu la suɠɔɠɔgi ma ziiti pɛ su, à deve ga wa-ɠoozunɛ vaa wola. <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ à suɠwɛɛ ga wa-ɠidaaleʋei zuɠɔɠɔ fai, naa ɠa é ʋaazu ga ziilɔɔi. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>À ɠaaɓa, wa-yiilɔɔi laazeeli kwɛgi ma, naa ɠa a kɛ wo laazeeli, ta wo ɠaavɔni fai pɛ su, peelalazu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo ʋa.<verse eid="JAS 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠimalai ta GALA falii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Ni nui ta ɠa wo zaama, balagai ɠimalai ma, kɛni é fali GALA ma, nii a fe bɛ, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka ɗa ɛsɛ pɛ kɔ ga faanɛɛi, zelilo faa nɔpɛ ge la ba. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Kɛlɛ é fali ga kidaaleʋei, é mina inɛinɛ, mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é inɛinɛsu, naa ɠulaʋɛ ga kpoloɗɛi ma lakpatakpagi, fiilɛi ɲiikpisu, é ɗa buzeɠe. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Naama nu zii mina ɠisiɛ ga toɠa ani zɔlɔɔ Maliɠii ya. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga kisupu nui, ki ge la ɠila siɛ ʋelei tanɔpɛ su.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baladai ta naavololai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Ɠɛɛɠɛloin é ga bala nui, é ɠoozunɛ mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka unbuzeɠe. <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>Ɠɛɛɠɛloin é ga naavolo nui, é ɠoozunɛ mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka maayeizu. Tɔɔzei naavolo nui ɠa leʋe eɠɛ tufa ʋuai. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Foloi a ɠulana, ná-die golai a ɗa galai wo, toɠa ɗa siinziin ganigi vɔ, ma ʋuai loo bu, ná-pagi ɲɛɛlɛ. Zekana é la ga naavolo nui, toɠa ɲɛɛlɛ ná-botiiti saama.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suɠɔɠɔgi ta tɛgai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, zɔi é losu kpaan suɠɔɠɔgi zu, mazɔlɔɔ suɠɔɠɔgi ʋoluma, toɠa pilɛ sɔlɔɔ masa bɔɔlɔgi zɔlɔɔ ga ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui, nii GALA ge minazeɠea la naati bɛ, niiti ti nɛa ʋɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Siɛgi zu tɛgai zeelizu la nui ta ma, é mina ɠɛ ma: «GALA ka é tɛ̀ɛzu ga.» Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la zooga lɛɛzu ga, é ʋa faa ɲɔi ɠɛ, tɔ ɓalaa la nu nɔpɛ tɛa ga. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Kɛlɛ nui ɠa lɛɛzu ga, siɛgi zu tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-gaazuɠulapɔi mɛɛnsu da, é yaava. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Tama gaazuɠulapɔi a kogi zeɠena, toɠa ɗa sɔlɔɔ ga kotoi. Kotoi laa ɠa zeelina mɛtu, é sɔlɔɔ ga saai.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>À mina ɓɔɠɔ yɛ ná wo ʋa yaava, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wɔi wo ga nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti. <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Faanɛɛ ʋagɔi kpein ta vebɛanii kɛɠala la ná, naa pɛ ka zeɠezu geezuʋɛ, GALA pɔ bɛ, é ga wozakalagi ma Ɠɛɛɠɛi. Tɔun pɔ bɛ, falibo ge la ná, falibogi ma maaniini ge la ɓalaa ná. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi yiimai ɠa é zɛnvui veeni la ade ya, ga daawooi maaʋele é ga gaamai, nii a kɛ de ɠɛ tosu mɔungi zu kpɛtɛaniiti pɛ saama.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA daawooi mɛni, è ziɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wɔi wo ga nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, à nii zuɠwɛɛ: Nui pɛ ge zuvilɛ ga faa mɛnigi, kɛlɛ é mina ɗa ɓɔɛ fala, é mina yiiɠaawana fala, <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>mazɔlɔɔ nui a yiiɠaawanana, é la mɔ naa laazeelia, nii é ga telebo fai GALA gaazu. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à kɔzɔba vaiti pɛ pili ya, ta nii pɛ a nu ɠɛ ga nu ɲɔu. Wooi nii siingai wo-yiimaʋɛ, à naa zo sɛsɛbogi zu, tɔ ɠa a zoo é wo-yɛnvuiti kizo. <verse eid="JAS 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>À wooi zo, wo ziɛ la. À mina kwɛ mɛnigi nɔ ʋa, wo ʋa ɓɔɠɔ yaava. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni nu a woilona wooi ma, é la ziɛni la, kulaʋɛ ga nui nii é ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛtɛsu pɛtɛgi zu nɔ, <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>é ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛtɛga ʋoluma, é li, é yeema gaamanɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛʋelei ma. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é ɠaazulosu tɔ daazeeliai ʋa, nii é wɔɔlɔyai veezu ade ya, é ɠili ba, é la nɔ ga é woilo ma, é yeema ma, kɛlɛ é ziɛzu la, naama nui undaa ɠa nɛ zɔlɔɔ GALA zea, ná-kɛɛwotiiti pɛ su.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Ni nui ta a ɓɔɠɔ ɠaana ga GALA pele ziɛ nu, tama é la zooni nɛgi zosu, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ yaavazu, ná-GALA pele ziɛi ɠa ga wafuun faa nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>GALA pele ɠitei ɲadegai Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA gaazu, naa ɠa é ga nu ɗa ɓɔ podointi ba ta poanzaiti ta-ɠidaaʋiligiti su, ta è mina ɓɔɠɔ yɛ ná, è ʋa ɠɔzɔ ga niima eteai zu vaiti maaʋele.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">À dama ga zeelɔzɔɠɔzu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wɔi wo eteai ziɛzu kidaaleʋei zu ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ma, é ga lɛbiya nui, à mina naa zupu ga zeelɔzɔɠɔzui. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Ni zunui ta a ʋaana wa-ɠaalɛbai zu, zanu balaɠaegi zee ʋa, seɠe ʋagɔi ma, ni bala nui ta ɓalaa ka ʋaana ná, maaɠili ʋelei ɲɔuɗai, <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>ni wa unfemai veena zunui naa ʋɛ, maaɠiliai ga pagɔ, wo ɠɛ ma: «Ʋa, è zei ʋɛ, seizu ʋagɔi zu,» kɛlɛ wo ɠɛ bala nui ma: «Ɗa ʋe, yɛ loni,» ɓaa «Zei zooi ma, ʋɛ kɔ̀ɠɔiti bu,» <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>zeelɔzɔɠɔzui la ga naa wo kɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ zaama ɓaa, wo ʋa ɗa tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe, nii kulaai kisiɛ ɲɔi zu?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>À woilo, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wɔi wo ga nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, GALA ge la yeeloni naati ba ɓaa, niiti ti ga bala nuiti eteai zu, ga ti ɓɛtɛ kidaaleʋei zu, ti ɠɛ ga masadai ma ʋogani zeɠe nuiti, nii é ma minazeɠe bogai naati bɛ, niiti ti nɛai ʋɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun, wa bala nui ʋɛlɛʋilisu! Naavolo nuiti taade, ti ʋa ɠɛ ta-zobogi laazu wo ma, ti ʋa li ga woye tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛti ɓaa? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Tiya laade ɓaa, ti ʋa ɠɛ woo ɲɔi wosu daasei pagɔi laalɔɠɔma, pɛai wo ʋa?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Gaamazu wa kɛɛzu ga pagɔ, ni wa masadai ma lɔgi ziɛzu, é zoloo GALA Sɛʋɛi ma ga: «È-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Kɛlɛ ni wa zeelɔzɔɠɔzui ɠɛɛzu, wa koto ɠɛɛzu naazu, tɔgi ɠa wo ʋeelalazu, tɔɔzei wo tɔ koloɠologi ɠɛa la. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nu nɔpɛ é tɔgi pɛ sosu, kɛlɛ a tɔgi ma levei gila kpe koloɠolona, é ɠɛa ga sɔba nu ti pɛ su. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Tɔɔzei zɔi é ɠɛni ma: «Mina wɛɛnziɛ bo,» naa ɠa é ɠɛni ma ɓalaa: «Mina nu ʋaa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-14">Ɛgz 20:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-18">TSV 5:17-18</ref></char>.</char></note> Kɛlɛ anɛɛ ni è la wɛɛnziɛ bosu, kɛlɛ ni ɗa nu ʋaana, è ɠɛa ga tɔ koloɠolo nui. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>À kpɔɛi wo, wo ziɛ eɠɛ nui niiti ti maanɛai ti lukpɔɠaaleʋe, é zoloo wɔɔlɔya lɔgi ma. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é la nua maawɔinɠaani, GALA ka naa lukpɔɠaaleʋe, é la maawɔinɠaa. Maawɔinɠai ɠa ɗa pilɛ sɔlɔɔ tukpɔi ma.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋei ta kɛɛwotiiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, naa ɠa lee ʋaa nu ma, ɗa ɠɛna ma: «Kidaaleʋei ɠa zèa,» ni è la dɛɛni ga ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti? Naama ɠidaaleʋei ɠa è ɠizo naazu ɓaa? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Ni ɠɛɛɠɛlointi saama, tanigaa ta ná, seɠe la ti ma, ti ʋalagai folo-o-folo ɠɔnɔgi ma, <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>nu ɠila ge yɛ wo zaama, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li ziilɛigi zu, à ɠɔɔlɛ, wo yiɠo,» ni wo la naa veeni ti ya, nii ti-ɓusɛi maavai ba, naa ɠa lee ʋaa ti ma? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Pele ɠana é la ga kidaaleʋei, ni é la lɛɛni ga kɛɛwotiiti, é zaa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Kɛlɛ ni nui ta a ɠɛna ma: «Kidaaleʋei ɠa è ya, nɔ̀un, kɛɛwotiiti,» naazu nà ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-ɠidaaleʋei lɛ ga ze, kɛɛwotiiti pɔ ge mina ɠɛ ba, nɔ̀un nà nà-kidaaleʋei lɛ ga ɗe ga kɛɛwotiiti.» <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>È laaʋɛ da ga GALA gila kpe nɔ ɠa é ná? Ɗa faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛzu ga naa. Kɛlɛ inɛgiti daaʋɛ naa la ɓalaa, ti zasu ɗa ɓali. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Ee, ɠimalala nui! Ɗa pɔ é lɛɛ ga ɗe ɓaa, ga kidaaleʋei kɛɛwotii la ba, ma ɲaka nɔ ʋe? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Ade-mɛmɛwola Abalaame la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele ɓaa, siɛgi zu é ná-doun zunui Izaake laani la zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>È pɛtɛga ga ná-kidaaleʋei ta ná-kɛɛwotiiti ti ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma, ná-kidaaleʋei laazeelini ga ná-kɛɛwotiiti, ti ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Naa ʋilɛni su naazu, nii GALA Sɛʋɛi boni ga: «Abalaame laani GALA da, naa leveni bɛ ga telebodai.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Zen 15:6</ref></char>.</char></note> É lolini ga GALA bɔɔlai. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Wa pɛtɛsu deɠɛmu, ga nui ɠa ɠɛ ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele, é ti ɠɛɛzu, kidaaleʋei letelegi nɔ laade, nii é zea. <verse eid="JAS 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Zenɔ ɠana é ɠɛɛni la ga koloɠolo anzanui Laɠaɓe, é ɠɛɛni ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga ná-kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele, é yeezeini Izilayɛle ɠeelaiti bu, é ɓɔ ti ʋa, ti li ga pele ɠili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Zoz 2:1-21</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ eɠɛʋelei kpusɛi zaai la, ni zɛnvui la su, zekana é la, ni kɛɛwotiiti ti la kidaaleʋei ʋa, saaʋɛ.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Dama ga è ɓɔɛ ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo ma mɔinmɔin ge mina ɠɛ ga kalamɔn, mazɔlɔɔ wo suɠwɛɛ ga gɛiti gi ga kalamɔinti, gá-lukpɔɠaaleʋei ɠa ɓaa gola. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Ade pɛ da ɗa ɠaka fai ma zii mɔinmɔin su. Zɔi é la ɠakasu pɛ kpɔɛzuɠulaiti su, naa ɠa é ga zunui daazeeliai fai pɛ su, a zoo é ziɛ kpusɛi wu, é ɓɔɠɔ zo fai pɛ su. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Da kɔlu ɓuɠai lɔɔzu sooiti daaʋɛ ga ti ɠolo de ʋɛ, da vɔnisu ɠana ti-ɓusɛi kpein ma. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Ɠigaiziɛ lɛɛ ɓato wolaiti su. Anɛɛ ni ti wɔɔlɔʋɛ gola, fiilɛ wolai ɗa ti laaʋili, ɓato laalati kɔlu goi ɠa ɗa ti laalati, ti li ga dii nui yiima ʋelei. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Zekana é la, nu nɛgi ɠa ga kpusɛi ʋaalobazu goi, kɛlɛ toɠa zoo é ɓɔɠɔ waso ga faa wolaiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Ɠigaiziɛ lɛɛ ɓalaa, ʋelei abu goi a ɗa so da dɔɓɔ wolai ʋa, é ná pɛ gala! <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Nu nɛgi ɓalaagi ɠa ga abui. Telebotala eteai ʋe. De-ɓusɛ ʋaalobazuʋɛ ta ʋe, tɔ ɠa a ɗa kpusɛi pɛ kɔzɔ. Tɔ ɠa a ɗa undaaʋiligi ma abui ʋili da-eteai zu vaiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, dɔɓɔ zuai ma zii pɛ, ta wɔniiti, naa ʋɛɛ kpokpo ganiiti, ta kpoloɗɛi wu aniiti pɛ ba, nuɓusɛi ɠa zoo é ti maaɠolo. Tama nuɓusɛi ɠa ɗa naa ɠɛ pɔlɔma. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa nɛgi maaɠolo. Toɠa ga faa ɲɔi, nu la zooga da, yeenɔpɛ daavegɛ ga nu ʋaa ani wanai. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Tɔ ɠa da ɗa de-Maliɠii de-Ɠɛɛ GALA maamusɛ la, tɔnɔ ɠa ɓalaa da ɗa nuɓusɛiti koto la, niiti ti ɓɛtɛai GALA maaniinigi zu. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Maamusɛ wooiti ta koto loo wooiti ti ɗa ɠula daa ɠilagi. Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa ɠɛ ɠana. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Ziɛun gilagi ɠa zoo é ziɛ ʋagɔi ta ziɛ ɲɔi ɠula ada ɠilagi ɓaa? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, kooleɠoole gului ɠa zoo é wolive wului ma waai wo ɓaa? Ɓaa dɔɔɓɔi ansaɠɔ tɔkulugi ɠa zoo é kooleɠoole gului ma waai wo ɓaa? Ɓa-o! Ziɛun gilagi nii kpoloi ma ɗɛi ʋa, naa la zooga ziɛ ʋagɔi ɠulazu ada ɠilagi miná nɔ.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠimalai é zeɠezu geezuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Ɠima nui ta keleɠele nui ɓɛ ɠa é wo zaama? É dɛɛ lɛɛ ga kɛɛwoti ʋagɔi, ti ɠɛɛzu ga sɛsɛbogi ta ɠimalai. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Kɛlɛ ni tolo ɲɔi ɠa wo-yiimaʋɛ, ta maaɠɔɔ fai, à mina waso, wo ʋa zɛɛi wo ga wo ɠɛlɛ vai gaamai ʋa. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Naama ɠimalai ma zii laade, é ʋa ʋa, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ. Kɛlɛ naa ɠa ga eteai nɔnɔi. GALA zɛnvui lɛi, é ʋa ɠɛ naa veezu, kɛni inɛgi. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋɛ nɔpɛ tolo ɲɔi ta maaɠɔɔ fai ná, faazupui ta faa ɲɔi ma zii pɛ ka é miná. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Ɠimalai paai, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ, mɔunpa ɲadegɛ, naa ʋolu ziilɛigi nɛɛʋɛ bɛ, ná-fai ɠaanɛ, kɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ ga é woilo zɔiti goo ma, daavegɛ ga gaazumaawɔinɠai, toɠa ɗa kɛɛwoti ʋagɔiti kɛ, é la zeelɔzɔɠɔzu ɠɛa, wooveleda la su. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Zɔiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu ziilɛi fai ma, nii ti fazasu ziilɛigi zu, ma zuwui ma waai ɠa ɠɛ ga telebodai.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ani wɔin ɲɔi zakpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Kpɔɛ vai ta sakpegiti ti wo zaama, naati seɠeʋɛ mini? Ta ɠulazu wo yiima vaa ɲɔiti su, ti kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu yeenɔpɛ wo-ɓusɛi zu. <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Wo ɠaazu ɠa ɠulazu ani mɔinmɔin ba, kɛlɛ wo-yiimai laa la zeelizu, naa maaʋele ma wa nuiti paazu. Wa gaazuɠulapɔi ɠɛɛzu, wo la naa zɔlɔɔsu nii wɔin wo ma, naa maaʋele ma wa zakpesu, wo ɲɛpii ɠɔ. Nii wɔin wo ma, wo la naa zɔlɔɔsu, tɔɔzei wo la falizu GALA ma. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Ni wa falina, wo la sɔlɔɔsu, tɔɔzei wa fali ʋele ɲɔu zu, nii a kɛ wo dɔ wo yiima vai nɔ zu.<verse eid="JAS 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Wooʋalada nuiti! Wo la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa, ga eteai ná-nɛɛbɛi ɠa ga GALA ná-wɔinzeɠemai? Zɔi deɠɛmu é pɔ é ɠɛ ga eteai bɔɔlai, naa ɠa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛzu ga GALA sili nui. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Toɠa wo ɠisu ga GALA Sɛʋɛi ɓɔɛni wafuun ɓaa, ga: «GALA wɔinʋɛ gola ga zɛnvui é seini ade-yiimaʋɛ»? <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, GALA ka ná-zaala wolai la de ma mɔnɔ, mazɔlɔɔ GALA Sɛʋɛi ɠɛ: «GALA ka waso nuiti sakpe, kɛlɛ toɠa ná-zaalai la ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">TFa 3:34</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Deɠɛmu à ɠolo GALA bɛ. À lo kpaan Inɛgi laalɔɠɔma, toɠa ʋela, é maaɠooza wo ʋa. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>À maaɓuɠa GALA ba, toɠa maaɓuɠa wo ʋa. À wo-yeeiti gaagba, kotoba nuiti, wo wo-yiimaʋɛti ɲade, ɠi fele nuiti! <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>À wa-maanɔɠɔ vai ɠwɛɛ, wo ɠaalɛi, wo wɔlɔ. À wa-ɲɛɛiti falibo ga gɔlɔi, wa-ɠoozunɛɛi valibo ga gaazuɠilii. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>À ɓɔɠɔmaayei Maliɠii ʋɛ, toɠa wo wuzeɠe.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɛɛɠɛloin lukpɔɠaaleʋe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à mina woo ɲɔu wo ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma. Zɔi a woo ɲɔu wo kɛɛɠɛloin laalɔɠɔma, ɓaa é tukpɔɠaaleʋe, naa ɠa woo ɲɔi wosu tɔgi laalɔɠɔma, é ɗa tɔgi lukpɔɠaaleʋe. Tama ni ɗa tɔgi lukpɔɠaaleʋezu, è la mɔ ga nui nii é ɠolozu tɔgi ʋɛ, kɛlɛ è ɠɛa ga tɔgi lukpɔɠaaleʋe nui. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Tama tɔgi zei nui ɠa ɠila kpe nɔ, tɔ ɠa é ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui, tɔ ɠila nɔ ɠa a zoo é nu ɠizo, ɓaa é nu undaaʋili. Ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ga leeni, ɗɛi è è-zeiɲɔɠɔi lukpɔɠaaleʋezu?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu mina ɠɛ ga waso nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>À woilo dɛɛ gòoi ma niina, wɔiti wo ɠɛɛzu ma: «Za ɓaa lina, gá liizu taa wolai ta zu, gi kona gila kɛ ná, gi yaaɠolai ɠɛ ná, gi tɔnɔ sɔlɔɔ.» <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Wo la kwɛɛ, nii a ɠɛ ga woye lina. Leeni ɠa é ga wa-eteai? Wo ɠɛɛʋɛ nɔ eɠɛʋelei ɓumugi la, é ɠulazu, é yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ ɠɛ, naa ʋolu é ɲɛɛlɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Wo maanɛɛni, wo ɠɛ ma: «Ni Maliɠii a vaana bu, gá yɛ vulua, gi nii ɠɛ, ɓaa nuu.» <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Kɛlɛ gaamazu, wa ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔzu wa-wasogi zu. Ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔ vai naa ma zii pɛ ɲɔuʋɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi é faa ʋagɔi ɠwɛɛ, nii maanɛai é kɛ, tama, é la kɛɛzu, naama nui kotoi ɠɛa.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Tookisui naavolo nuiti faa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>À woilo gòoi ma, wa ʋe, wo ga naavolo nuiti! À wɔlɔ, wo ɓalakpala, tɔɔzei maanɔɠɔi maaʋele ma, é ʋaazu wo ʋɔ! <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Wa-naavoloiti ti luulaa, ɓaɠaɓaɠaiti ti wa-zeɠeiti kpotaɓotaga. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Koikoigi wa-zanugiti ta wa-wali ɠaeiti koloɠologa, koikoigi naa ɠa é ga zeele wooi wo laalɔɠɔma, toɠa wo-ɓusɛi ɠoloɠolo eɠɛ abui. Wo naavoloi ɠaalɛa ba niima voloiti su, ti ga folo ɠaaɓelagiti. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Pɛtɛ, wo la botiɠɛ nuiti salai veeni ti ya, niiti ti wa-ɓalagiti teʋeai. À woilo dɛɛ ti-zalai ɓain gooi ma! Molo leʋe nuiti kpain gooi zeelia Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii GALA ma. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Wo wa-eteai ziɛʋɛ gaanɛɛi zu ta ɓɔɠɔyiimai zu. Wo ɓɔɠɔ maalɔtɔʋɛ eɠɛ toganiiti wo ɠɔdaaleʋe voloi vaa zu. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Wo telebo nui ʋeelalani, wo paa, é la wo zakpeni.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ziilɔɔi ʋoluɠulai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Deɠɛmu, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à yiilɔɔ eyɛsu Maliɠii ʋa. À wɛlɛ ʋelei tii ɠɛɛ nui a ɗa zooi ʋaalɔnɔ pagɔiti maaɓɔun da gola. Toɠa ɗa yiilɔɔ, eyɛsu é tona mɔungi zɔlɔɔ, ta ma ɠaaɓelagi é ʋuuzu. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Wa ɓalaagi, à yiilɔɔ, wo zɛbɛzeɠe, mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii ʋaa vai maaɓuɠaa.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à mina ɓaazaɠa ga ɓɔɠɔ lɔɠɔ wo ɠilagilagiti, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA ge mina wo lukpɔɠaaleʋe. Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nui maaɓuɠaa, toɠa niina loni pɛlɛlaʋɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, GALA goo wo nuiti ti ɓɔɛni Maliɠii laaseigi zu, naati ta-ɓɔlɔi ta ta-yiilɔɔi ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga poo pagɔi, wo ɠizɛ su. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Pɛtɛ, niiti ti loni kpaan, da ɠɛɛzu naati ma, undaanɛɛ ɠa ti ʋɛ. Wo Zɔɓe ná-ziilɔɔ vai mɛnini, wo suɠwɛɛ nii Maliɠii kɛɛni bɛ gaaɓelagi zu. Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii laavegɛ ga nuɓɔɠɔlai ta maawɔinɠai.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaama ɓɔɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, faa nɔpɛ su, à mina ɠona, geeɠɔlɔgi ma, ɓaa zooi ma, ɓaa ga konai ma zii nɔpɛ. Kɛlɛ wa ɠɛna: «Ungo,» é ɠɛ ga: «Ungoi», wa ɠɛna: «Ɓa,» é ɠɛ ga: «Ɓagi», naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina loo GALA ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋei zu.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Telebo nui ná-GALA falii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Ta ɠa wo zaama, é kpɔlɔi zu ɓaa? Kɛni é GALA fali. Ta ɠa ná koozunɛai ɓaa? Naa maamusɛ wuyeiti too. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Ta ɠa wo zaama, é zeeɓɛzu ɓaa? Naa Egilisi lotuɠɔiti toli, ti GALA fali ma, ti gulɔi ziɛ ma Maliɠii laaseigi zu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>GALA falii é ɠɛɛzu ga kidaaleʋei, toɠa seeɓɛ nui ɠizo, Maliɠii ɠa kɛdɛyai ve bɛ. Ni é kotoa ɠɛɛʋɛ, naati suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Deɠɛmu, à laa zɔ ga ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ga wa-ɠotoiti, wo GALA fali ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ wo ɠilagilagi pɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ wo ɠɛdɛ. Zɛbɛi ɠa telebo nui ná-GALA falii ʋa, toɠa ɗa faa wola ʋaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Eli ɠɛni ga nuɓusɛi ga de ɠɛʋele, é ɠilini GALA falii ʋa ga tona mina ʋu, tona la ɠɛni ʋuuni zooi ma, eyɛsu kona saʋagɔ alu dɔzita. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Naa ʋolu, é GALA falini mɔnɔ, geeɠɔlɔgi yeeɓe tonai ʋa, zooi ná-kulanumaiti fe.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaka nuiti ti-ɠalema vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ni wo ta a ɠakana, é maaɠooza gaamai ʋa, taɠili ge gaaɠale ma ʋolu, é ʋaa la, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>à suɠwɛɛ ga zɔi é ʋaazu ga kotoba nui, é seɠe kaka pelei ma, naa ɠa ma nui yɛnvui ɠizosu saai ma, toɠa ɠɛ ga zaɓu kotoi ma mɔinmɔin suvaayɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
